# AME Core

This repository is isolated. Do not touch sibling repos, Carbon/CTS platforms, or owner production systems.

Authoritative contracts live in `backend/ame/contracts/`. Do not invent parallel schemas.

PostgreSQL is the system of record. Agents persist tasks, decisions, events, and results. Prompt history is not memory.

Content lifecycle is explicit. Never infer critical state from missing fields.

Dry-run uses the real workflow and labels synthetic records `simulation = true`. Production publishers refuse simulated content.

LLM output is data. Validate with Pydantic. Never execute model output.

No credentials in Git. Never log tokens, cookies, passwords, or OAuth secrets.

Director cannot raise `DAILY_AI_SPEND_LIMIT`, `DAILY_MEDIA_SPEND_LIMIT`, or `MAX_CONTENT_PER_DAY`.

Official APIs only. No scraping authenticated pages, watermark removal, DRM bypass, fake engagement, or fabricated revenue/metrics.
